BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Songbyrd Music House": "https://dice.fm/event/nvnql9-value-select-13th-aug-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:songbyrd
SUMMARY:Value Select
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260813T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260813T230000
UID:48d67d49d9649b14e23c32e188df1ac5@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Thursday August 13th Value Select w/ Discoholic\, JREG \\*\\*\
 \* The Moonkiller Grand National Tour sold over 8\,000 tickets across 24 s
 hows — covering 12\,000 miles of North American road. People flew in fro
 m overseas. Some followed the tour to two\, three\, four cities. It was\, 
 by any measure\, a thing that happened — and that people chose to make h
 appen. We're doing it again. Tighter. Sexier. Musically-er... Funniest..es
 t-er(?) than before\\*... Also\, Internationally\\*\\* The same people who
  were there last time already know. The question is whether you'll be amon
 g them this time... \\*subject to interpretation\, not legally binding. \\
 *\\*USA and Canada\, this technically counts \\*\\*\\* On stage\, Discohol
 ic is a Washington\, D.C-based DJ & performer who isn’t afraid to have f
 un—fusing funky sensibilities\, buttery-smooth transitions\, & healthy d
 oses of physical comedy—all while maintaining an extremely dance-friendl
 y groove that goes down smooth. Think of him as a bartender of discoholic 
 beverages that can satisfy your tastes. Whether you want to dance or laugh
  the night away—Discoholic can serve you. Since 2019\, Discoholic has pl
 ayed across the nation (with electropop duo Cherub\, vaporwave icon FrankJ
 avCee\, & disco legend Cerrone) & across the web (300+ live Twitch viewers
 ). In the studio\, Discoholic is a collective creating disco-inspired musi
 c infused w/ vibrant flavors of R&B. Their dreamy debut album Illusion has
  enraptured early fans\, & their sophomore album Discoholics Anonymous rai
 ses the bar with more fun\, more meaningful\, & all-around more impressive
  music. (And glowing endorsements from Vaporwave veterans Skylar Spence\, 
 Luxury Elite\, & Dan Mason!)
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/nvnql9-value-select-13th-aug-songbyrd-washington
 -dc-tickets
X-SOURCE:Songbyrd
END:VEVENT
