SUMMARY:Rome Streetz - "Sock It To My Pocket" Tour
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260814T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260814T230000
UID:f6e8b6a5fa1790ec5d9ea8fd02efba72@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Rome Streetz is a critically acclaimed rapper known for his sh
 arp lyricism\, gritty storytelling\, and authentic street narratives. Emer
 ging from Brooklyn’s underground hip-hop scene\, he has built a loyal fo
 llowing through a series of acclaimed releases and collaborations with som
 e of the genre’s most respected producers and artists. His distinctive d
 elivery\, vivid wordplay\, and uncompromising approach have established hi
 m as one of the leading voices in modern underground rap. Rome Streetz is 
 currently preparing for the release of his upcoming album\, “Sock It To 
 My Pocket”\, which is expected to feature several surprise guest appeara
 nces. The project continues his tradition of delivering hard-hitting lyric
 ism and elite-level collaborations while expanding his already impressive 
 catalog.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/7dbpvp-rome-streetz-sock-it-to-my-pocket-tour-14
 th-aug-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets
