BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Songbyrd Music House": "https://dice.fm/event/v32arg-the-no-headliners-tour-16th-aug-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:songbyrd
SUMMARY:The No Headliners Tour
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260816T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260816T230000
UID:aa4732e5f6d09624bed7e306d4d5b7b0@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, August 16th The No Headliners Tour ft. Heno.\, Kwame 
 Adu\, My Favorite Color\, zayALLCAPS The No Headliners Tour prioritizes in
 timate venues\, creating immersive experiences\, where lineups each night 
 are designed as cohesive experiences. The result is a community-driven atm
 osphere\, centered on authenticity\, discovery\, and meaningful connection
 . \\*\\*\\* HENO. The 1st-generation Ethiopian/Eritrean artist's versatili
 ty knows no bounds\, with collaborations with artists such as Mick Jenkins
 \, JPEGMAFIA\, Elujay\, and many more. Heno. is set to start rolling out h
 is collaborative album with Oddisee in Spring 2026\, accompanied by a full
  European tour ending in early summer. \\*\\*\\* Kwame Adu The New Jersey 
 native has opened for the likes of Vayda\, Tommy Richman\, and\, most rece
 ntly Redveil in Santa Ana. He has a new EP planned for August. \\*\\*\\* M
 y Favorite Color A master of unorthodox lyricism with a visual sense to ma
 tch\, the Pittsburgh artist who has a knack for going viral is fresh of th
 e release of his new album "Elmer" and looks to continue his momentum on t
 our. \\*\\*\\* zayALLCAPS The LA-based rapper-producer has positioned hims
 elf as a standout voice within the next wave of culturally aware\, interne
 t native artists\, with his most recent project\, "art Pop \\* pop art" re
 ceiving critical acclaim from the likes of The Fader\, Pigeons and Planes\
 , and Pitchfork. This tour will come at the heels of his highly anticipate
 d new album\, making this tour a pivotal moment in his career trajectory. 
 Zay has performed consistently across the country\; most recently being bo
 oked for Big: Culture and Arts Festival in Florida.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/v32arg-the-no-headliners-tour-16th-aug-songbyrd-
 washington-dc-tickets
X-SOURCE:Songbyrd
END:VEVENT
