BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Songbyrd Music House": "https://dice.fm/event/mxg92l-time-in-the-wilderness-26th-aug-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:songbyrd
SUMMARY:Time in the Wilderness
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260826T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260826T230000
UID:999777883bb9fa59176c3189067a69d0@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday August 26th Time in the Wilderness w/ Last Legs\, Do
 ll Apartments\, The Delarcos \\*\\*\\* Time in the Wilderness captivates a
 udiences with original\, engaging instrumental grooves that transport list
 eners into uncharted musical territories. Based in Washington\, DC\, the q
 uintet skillfully blends soundscapes and improvisational elements to explo
 re themes of hope and discovery\, seamlessly weaving together genres throu
 gh intricate rhythms. Dueling drummers (Brad Samuels and Paul Aquilino) cr
 aft a unified pocket of polyrhythms\, starting a topic with bass player (M
 ike Landis) on both 4-string and 6-string tic-tac bass\, juicing the hook.
  Themes are cultivated\, nurtured and destroyed on meandering planes estab
 lished by guitar\, synth and other sonic devices (Andre Radloff). Soaring 
 and catchy\, masterful trumpet (Ralph Burrows) transports us to other sphe
 res. \\*\\*\\* Last Legs is an indie rock band from New Jersey. Formed in 
 2021\, they released a self-titled debut album on Our Days Are Numbered re
 cords in June 2024. Their music is a merger of eclectic influences includi
 ng 90’s indie rock\, early new wave\, with influences of bands like Spar
 ks and Suicide.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/mxg92l-time-in-the-wilderness-26th-aug-songbyrd-
 washington-dc-tickets
X-SOURCE:Songbyrd
END:VEVENT
