UID:34d1e8fdc60b078137037be0f7de3fa1@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Saint Harison is an artist with an undeniable voice from South
 ampton\, United Kingdom\, currently living in Los Angeles. Called one of t
 he “great voices not just from the UK\, but of all time” by Elton John
 \, Saint has quickly become a fan favorite with nods from Justin Bieber\, 
 Jazmine Sullivan\, SZA and more. He was recently named on Rolling Stone’
 s Future of Music list. Citing Amy Winehouse and Frank Ocean as key musica
 l influences\, Saint has been covered by British Vogue\, Rolling Stone\, N
 PR\, GQ\, CLASH\, Variety\, Pigeons & Planes etc. and was named Apple Musi
 c's global Up Next artist. He made his late night TV debut on Jimmy Kimmel
  Live! after his viral COLORS performance of “ego talkin\,” which spar
 ked the viral #egotalkinchallenge on TikTok. After being sampled by UK sup
 erstar Dave in fall 2025\, Saint released his long-awaited sophomore EP gh
 osted with a span of singles including “bad\,” which recently hit #1 o
 n US R&B radio.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
