X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Songbyrd Music House": "https://dice.fm/event/mxgo89-tobi-lou-same-old-jeans-tour-20th-sep-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:songbyrd
SUMMARY:tobi lou - Same Old Jeans Tour
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260920T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260920T230000
UID:02a8bdebd2913cf7eabe64821148c9d8@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:tobi lou is a genre-blurring artist whose unique sound and ima
 ginative visuals have cemented him as a standout voice in today’s music 
 scene. Born in Nigeria and raised in Chicago\, tobi fuses hip-hop\, R&B\, 
 and pop with infectious melodies\, blending introspection with playful ene
 rgy that continues to captivate a loyal and growing fanbase. Before music\
 , tobi chased a career in professional baseball\, but an injury shifted hi
 s path—ultimately leading him to discover his true passion. His breakout
  single “Troop” introduced the world to his sound\, but it was the vir
 al success of “Buff Baby”—an ode to Adventure Time—that launched h
 im into the spotlight. The track became a massive hit on TikTok and is now
  RIAA certified Gold. tobi’s momentum carried into his first headline ru
 n—the sold-out 24-city Live on Ice Tour—which brought his signature st
 age presence to fans across the country. Later\, he delivered a standout h
 ometown performance at Lollapalooza that was widely praised by outlets lik
 e Hulu\, who named it one of the festival’s best sets. Beyond the music\
 , tobi is deeply involved in the creative direction of his work. He co-dir
 ects many of his visuals with longtime collaborator Glassface\, crafting a
  distinct aesthetic that’s become integral to his artistry. He also lead
 s his own fashion brand\, Farada\, which recently debuted its first origin
 al show—blurring the lines between music\, style\, and storytelling. His
  latest album\, Decent\, received widespread acclaim and features standout
  collaborations with fellow Chicago heavyweights Chief Keef\, Polo G\, and
  Saba\, as well as NBA All-Star Damian Lillard (aka Dame D.O.L.L.A). He al
 so teamed up with Young Thug on “Cobra\,” a smooth\, atmospheric track
  that reveals a more introspective side of tobi’s sound. Fresh off the s
 old-out Escape From Wiscansin Tour alongside R&B legend T-Pain\, tobi went
  on to headline his own 25-city run\, The Perish Blue Tour\, further cemen
 ting his reputation as a must-see performer. With unmatched versatility an
 d vision\, tobi lou isn’t just making music—he’s building a universe
  of his own.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/mxgo89-tobi-lou-same-old-jeans-tour-20th-sep-son
 gbyrd-washington-dc-tickets
X-SOURCE:Songbyrd
END:VEVENT
