BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Songbyrd Music House": "https://dice.fm/event/6dov9b-laerz-1st-oct-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:songbyrd
SUMMARY:LAERZ
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261001T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261001T230000
UID:974d19c1a70726182f8827ebd5ac11e5@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:LAERZ is an LA based electronic artist redefining what a DJ se
 t can be. Blurring the line between live production and performance\, he b
 uilds tracks in real time\, stacking cinematic vocals\, sculpting synths\,
  triggering drum pads\, and weaving loops into fully immersive\, high volt
 age moments. No two sets are the same. Every drop is built live. Every cho
 rus feels earned. He first captured global attention through his busking s
 tyle performances and on the spot content creation\, transforming sidewalk
 s and unexpected spaces into stages. That raw\, human approach resonated\,
  building a fiercely organic audience of over 4 million followers across s
 ocial media. That momentum translated offline as well\, culminating in a 2
 2 date headline tour that brought his immersive live show to audiences acr
 oss the country. What began as viral moments has evolved into something mo
 re focused: intentional releases crafted to live far beyond the scroll. So
 nically\, LAERZ exists where emotional depth meets dancefloor impact. His 
 current sound leans into break driven records that are percussive\, kineti
 c\, and built to move. Think the bounce and forward momentum of Daniel All
 an and Nimino layered with the wide\, ethereal vocal worlds of M83 and Emp
 ire of the Sun. The result is music that feels both massive and intimate\,
  pairing deep basslines and shimmering reverbs with stacked cinematic voca
 ls and rhythms that strike just as hard in a packed club as they do on a f
 estival stage at sunset. At his core\, LAERZ creates dance music that feel
 s human. Imperfect in the right ways. Emotional without losing its edge. I
 mmersive without sacrificing energy. Whether performing on a main stage\, 
 inside a dark club\, or curating a late night headphone session\, he deliv
 ers music meant to be felt\, not just heard. With a global audience behind
  him and a sharpened artistic vision ahead\, LAERZ is stepping into his mo
 st intentional era yet. The momentum is undeniable. The sound is evolving.
  And this is only the beginning.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/6dov9b-laerz-1st-oct-songbyrd-washington-dc-tick
 ets
X-SOURCE:Songbyrd
END:VEVENT
