SUMMARY:Tim Atlas
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261002T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261002T230000
UID:b025f76d2a717b9abacd67eb1a0747cf@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Known for his intimate blend of R&B\, indie pop\, and alternat
 ive soul\, Tim Atlas first broke through with his 2018 EP All Talk!\, earn
 ing early comparisons to artists like Toro y Moi\, Unknown Mortal Orchestr
 a\, and Rex Orange County. That release sparked immediate momentum\, drawi
 ng support from tastemakers including Zane Lowe (Beats 1) and Arielle Free
  (BBC Radio 1)\, alongside coverage from Paste\, Complex\, Clash\, The Lin
 e of Best Fit\, and a songwriting Grammy for best gospel record as the che
 rry on top. Since then\, he's amassed over 150 million streams\, global pl
 aylist support from Spotify and Apple Music\, and toured internationally w
 ith The Magic City Hippies and Goldroom\, with standout appearances at The
  Great Escape Festival (UK) and Noise Pop (San Francisco).
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/l8xbxp-tim-atlas-2nd-oct-songbyrd-washington-dc-
 tickets
