X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Songbyrd Music House": "https://dice.fm/event/xe3xml-ella-boh-blurry-tour-6th-oct-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:songbyrd
SUMMARY:Ella Boh: Blurry Tour
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261006T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261006T230000
UID:521bcdcdd262a7d625681ad79703429d@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Ella Boh is a dark pop artist based in Los Angeles\, Californi
 a crafting haunting melodies\, cinematic storytelling\, and self-written a
 nd self-produced records. She has built one of alternative pop’s fastest
 -growing communities and cultivated a dedicated global audience through im
 mersive visuals and emotionally raw storytelling. Following the success of
  her debut project milk & honey\, Ella launched her darkest and most ambit
 ious era yet with the BLURRY EP. Led by fan-favorite releases "SERiAL KiLL
 ER\," "iNSOMNiAC\," and "BLOODY MARY\," the project has amassed more than 
 9.2 million Spotify streams\, reached more than 1 million listeners\, gene
 rated over 400K playlist adds\, and contributed to a catalog that now exce
 eds 56+ million global lifetime streams. The release was supported by more
  than 14K presaves\, international editorial support\, and tour dates alon
 gside Artemas and Ari Abdul. Blending vulnerability\, horror-inspired imag
 ery\, and gritty alternative-pop production\, Ella creates immersive world
 s where every release reveals another chapter in an interconnected story. 
 More than a musician\, she is building an ever-evolving creative universe 
 that continues to resonate with fans around the world.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/xe3xml-ella-boh-blurry-tour-6th-oct-songbyrd-was
 hington-dc-tickets
X-SOURCE:Songbyrd
END:VEVENT
