X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Songbyrd Music House": "https://dice.fm/event/avxoev-staring-in-spaces-single-release-show-10th-oct-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:songbyrd
SUMMARY:Staring in Spaces (Single Release Show)
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261010T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261010T220000
UID:81d007fdeb7058a063e668322f1e33e5@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Saturday October 10th Staring in Spaces (Single Release Show) 
 w/ Endlings \\+ FREE after party w/ DJ FIBI and Yoshmo! \\*\\*\\* Staring 
 in Spaces: The pop duo bringing infectious energy to the Nation's Capital.
  Childhood friends Jack Wright and William Lorenz began their musical jour
 ney in small-town Wisconsin\, quickly gaining momentum with their debut al
 bum Stop Talking. Now settled in D.C.\, Staring in Spaces released their b
 oldest and most ambitious album yet\, Kissing!\, at the end of 2024. Featu
 ring standout singles like the punchy "my mom/your dad" and the nostalgic 
 "Postcard\," the album pushes their pop sensibilities into rougher texture
 s and edgier performances. With a successful tour behind them and energize
 d audiences craving more. Wright and Lorenz are diving headfirst into 2026
 . \\*\\*\\* Endlings are four friends making music at the event horizon. D
 rawing on a wide and varied set of influences\, their music has emerged as
  raw and expansive\, dark and exploratory. They are making heads bang and 
 hearts throb at music venues across the D.C. metro area with a bleeding ed
 ge sound. The old world is dying\, and the new world struggles to be born:
  now is the time of monsters.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/avxoev-staring-in-spaces-single-release-show-10t
 h-oct-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets
