UID:60804531690b821408f300ff2410c7b9@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Saturday October 10th SIS The Afterparty! ft. DJ FIBI & Yoshmo
  \\*\\*\\* Stay after the SiS Single Release Show for THE AFTERPARTY! DJ F
 IBI and Yoshmo are going to absolutely rock our socks off with two amazing
  sets back to back 🪩 10pm - DJ FIBI 🕺 12am - Yoshmo \\*\\*\\* FIBI i
 s a Washington\, DC based DJ blending progressive house\, tech house\, mel
 odic bass\, hyperpop\, and disco genres into energetic\, pop-driven sets. 
 Influenced by fresh alternative EDM and eurodance classics\, FIBI creates 
 a high-energy community-driven dance floor that keeps people moving all ni
 ght. \\*\\*\\* DC based dj\, Yoshmo\, is a new face in the budding DMV DJ 
 scene. Playing everything from electro and hyperpop to jungle and hardcore
 \, there’s never a dull moment on the dance floor when they’re behind 
 the decks!
