BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Songbyrd Music House": "https://dice.fm/event/2w5g2o-jailen-josey-the-serial-romantic-tour-17th-oct-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:songbyrd
SUMMARY:Jai'Len Josey - The Serial Romantic Tour
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T230000
UID:d81942bcc2b35a2c3842ce453840b4fc@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Saturday October 17th Jai'Len Josey - The Serial Romantic Tour
  \\*\\*\\* Jai’Len Josey weaves a vibrant\, vulnerable\, and vital patch
 work of sounds and experiences together in her music. All kinds of romanti
 c happenings and mis-happenings replay across a soundscape steeped in styl
 es as diverse as R&B\, hip-hop\, old school Detroit House\, and even timel
 ess musical theater. This kaleidoscope of vibes projects her personality o
 ut loud not only as a Platinum-selling singer-songwriter\, musician\, and 
 Broadway star\, but also as a confident and charismatic woman\, impassione
 d poet\, and visionary creator. Rewinding back to high school\, she often 
 watched YouTube videos and vocally mimed instruments like cello\, bass\, a
 nd flute to develop a distinct delivery that would later serve her well. G
 iven her versatility\, she went from shining on Broadway as “Pearl” in
  The SpongeBob Musical: Live on Stage! to launching a successful solo care
 er. She sharpened an incomparable signature style on Illustrations EP \\[2
 020\\] and SOUTHERN DELICACY EP \\[2023\\]. Emerging as an in-demand songw
 riter behind-the-scenes\, she penned a pair of songs on Ari Lennox’s Age
 /Sex/Location\, including the platinum-certified “Pressure.” Hitting t
 he road\, Lennox handpicked her as support on the Age/Sex/Location Tour. M
 oreover\, she received acclaim from the likes of Billboard\, VIBE\, Rated 
 R&B\, YouKnowIGotSoul\, ESSENCE\, Okayplayer\, and more. Now\, she seamles
 sly wraps all of her emotions and experiences into one cohesive body of wo
 rk on her full-length debut LP\, Serial Romantic\\[Def Jam Recordings\\]
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/2w5g2o-jailen-josey-the-serial-romantic-tour-17t
 h-oct-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets
X-SOURCE:Songbyrd
END:VEVENT
